> FUNCTION: Adjudicate Claim            TYPE: EXCEXTFUN
> FILE:     Claim                       MODEL: CLMMDL
> PURPOSE:  Run validation and pricing for one claim and record the outcome.
>
> PARAMETERS
>   I  Claim ID                  CLCLID
>   O  Adjudication Status       CLSTAT
>
.-
.  Claim                 *  RTVOBJ  Retrieve Claim
.  .  Claim ID           I  PAR.Claim ID
.  .  Claim Status       O  LCL.Claim Status
.  .  Member ID          O  LCL.Member ID
.-
.-CASE
.|-LCL.Claim Status is *Not Found
.|  PAR.Adjudication Status = CND.Error
.|  <-- *QUIT
.|-LCL.Claim Status is Rejected
.|  PAR.Adjudication Status = CND.Rejected
.|  <-- *QUIT
.'-ENDCASE
.-
.  Claim                 *  EXCEXTFUN  Validate Claim (CLMVAL)
.  .  Claim ID           I  PAR.Claim ID
.  .  Result             O  LCL.Claim Status
.-
.-CASE
.|-LCL.Claim Status is Validated
.|  Claim                 *  EXCEXTFUN  Price Claim (CLMPRC)
.|  .  Claim ID           I  PAR.Claim ID
.|  Claim                 *  RTVOBJ  Retrieve Claim
.|  .  Claim ID           I  PAR.Claim ID
.|  .  Claim Status       O  LCL.Claim Status
.'-ENDCASE
.-
.-CASE
.|-LCL.Claim Status is Pended
.|  Claim Audit           *  CRTOBJ  Write Audit Entry
.|  .  Claim ID           I  PAR.Claim ID
.|  .  Audit Reason       I  CON.MISSING PRICE OR PLAN TIER
.'-ENDCASE
.-
.  PAR.Adjudication Status = LCL.Claim Status
